==English==

===Pronunciation===
*{{rhymes|ʌtʃə(r)}}

===Etymology===
# From [[touch]].
# To ''"[[touch]] someone for money"'', [[touch]] used in a [[colloquial]] sense.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# One who [[touches]].
# {{context|Geordie|pejorative}} [[toucha]]; one who tries get something out of others for nothing in return.

